evidence = "On main, services/agent/crates/layerx-client/src/sequencer.rs:869 requires a keys object with numeric, positive height ranges, while services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/human_node.rs:92 and services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/handshake_gate.rs:105 still supply bare lists with hexadecimal height strings. services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/human_node_budgets.rs:213 already supplies the required object and numeric heights, leaving the other two fixtures incompatible with the decoder."
